      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_16a",
      "hash64": "5A0576D17235D494",
      "text": "¿La delegada? ¡Pues claro!\\c\\nPuede con cualquier Pokémon que se le ponga\\npor delante. ¡Esa tía es una máquina![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_16b",
      "hash64": "5A0579D17235D9AD",
      "text": "¿Noa? ¿Esa hacker tan lista que resultó ser\\nla líder del Team Star?\\c\\nElla sería perfecta, desde luego, pero...\\c\\n¿Cómo te las apañas para hacer amigos en\\ncírculos tan turbios?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 178,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_16c",
      "hash64": "5A0578D17235D7FA",
      "text": "¿La delegada? La verdad es que ella sería\\nperfecta, pero...\\c\\nHasta que consigas el rango de Campe[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]ónona y\\nestés a su nivel, dudo que logremos convencerla.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 160,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_16d",
      "hash64": "5A0573D17235CF7B",
      "text": "¿Eh? Pues no me suena...\\c\\nPero me da la sensación de que, si queremos que\\nnos ayude alguien así, tendremos que ganarnos\\r\\nsu confianza o no llegaremos a ninguna parte.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 170,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_17a",
      "hash64": "5A0252D172336191",
      "text": "Bueno, estamos en contacto.\\c\\nSi uno consigue que más gente se una a nuestra\\ncausa, que llame al otro, ¿vale?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
